DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ccmmppccii driver supports the C-Media CMI8338A, CMI8338B, CMI8738,
     CMI8738B and CMI8768 sound chips present in some PCI sound cards and some
     integrated PC motherboard chipsets (such as the SiS 530).

     Hardware features:

           ••   Supports 8 common sample rates from 5512 Hz to 48000 Hz

           ••   Hardware full-duplex support enables simultaneous record and
               playback

           ••   Some CMI8738 versions support 4 and 6 channel playback

           ••   CMI8768 chips support 4, 6, and 8 channel playback

           ••   CMI8768 chips can only record sample rates of 44100 Hz or 48000
               Hz

           ••   Hardware copying of front to rear for playing stereo input on 4
               speakers

           ••   S/PDIF input and output

